@startuml
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam ResponseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "User" as User

box "Client Side (MLTF)" #LightBlue
participant "mltf_frontend\n(Auth0 SDK)" as Frontend
end box

box "Identity Providers" #LightYellow
participant "Auth0\nAuthorization Server" as Auth0
participant "Google IDP" as Google
end box

box "Secure Backend (MLTF)" #LightGreen
participant "Spring Boot API" as Backend
end box

== 1. Initiate Authentication ==
User -> Frontend: Click "Login with Google"
activate Frontend
Frontend -> Frontend: Generate PKCE Pair\n(Code Verifier & Code Challenge)
Frontend -> User: Redirect to Auth0 /authorize\n(client_id, code_challenge, redirect_uri)
deactivate Frontend

== 2. Identity Federation via Google ==
User -> Auth0: Present credentials / Request Authorization
activate Auth0
Auth0 -> User: Display login choices
User -> Auth0: Select "Continue with Google"
Auth0 -> Google: Redirect to Google Accounts
activate Google
Google -> User: Prompt for Google Login & Consent
User --> Google: Approve authentication
Google -> Auth0: Return Auth Code to Auth0 callback
deactivate Google

== 3. Token Exchange (PKCE Verification) ==
Auth0 -> Frontend: Redirect to MLTF callback_url\nwith Auth Code
deactivate Auth0
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Auth0: POST /oauth/token\n(auth_code, code_verifier, client_id)
activate Auth0
Auth0 -> Auth0: Verify code_verifier against\noriginal code_challenge
Auth0 --> Frontend: Return Tokens (ID Token & Access Token JWT)
deactivate Auth0

Frontend -> Frontend: Store Access Token safely in memory
Frontend -> User: Redirect to MLTF Dashboard (Authenticated)
deactivate Frontend

== 4. Propagating JWT to MLTF Secure Resources ==
User -> Frontend: Click "Start KYC Upload" (Step 2)
activate Frontend
Frontend -> Backend: GET /api/v1/kyc/status\nHeaders: [Authorization: Bearer <JWT>]
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend: Intercept Request\nValidate JWT signature via Auth0 JWKS
Backend --> Frontend: Return KYC Status (200 OK)
deactivate Backend
Frontend -> User: Render KYC Upload Interface
deactivate Frontend
@enduml
